### Functions

User-defined functions that return a single value.

```sql
-- Scalar function
CREATE FUNCTION GetBonus(salary DECIMAL(10,2))
RETURNS DECIMAL(10,2)
DETERMINISTIC
BEGIN
    RETURN salary * 0.1;
END;

-- Use in queries
SELECT Name, Salary, GetBonus(Salary) AS Bonus FROM Employees;
```

**Difference from Stored Procedures:**

| Aspect | Function | Stored Procedure |
|--------|----------|------------------|
| Returns | Single value | Result set or nothing |
| Use in SQL | Yes (in SELECT) | No (CALL only) |
| Side effects | Not allowed | Allowed |
| Parameters | IN only | IN, OUT, INOUT |

