### Triggers

Automatically execute when certain events occur.

```sql
-- Audit trigger
CREATE TABLE AuditLog (
    ID INT AUTO_INCREMENT PRIMARY KEY,
    TableName VARCHAR(50),
    Action VARCHAR(10),
    RecordID INT,
    ChangedAt TIMESTAMP DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);

CREATE TRIGGER AfterEmployeeUpdate
AFTER UPDATE ON Employees
FOR EACH ROW
BEGIN
    INSERT INTO AuditLog (TableName, Action, RecordID)
    VALUES ('Employees', 'UPDATE', NEW.ID);
END;
```

**Trigger types:**
| Timing | Event | Description |
|--------|-------|-------------|
| BEFORE | INSERT | Validate before insert |
| AFTER | INSERT | Log after insert |
| BEFORE | UPDATE | Validate before update |
| AFTER | UPDATE | Log after update |
| BEFORE | DELETE | Prevent deletion |
| AFTER | DELETE | Archive deleted data |

